	moFHfdfLroQFnoECCsQAQ&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3o8Js_L2oLYPU6ZhKW7DLk) joins the Bon
	iuk Institute's Religion and Public Live Center for an in-person conversat
	ion with director Todd Ferguson about the future of religion in America.  
	&#160\;About Religious &amp\; Civic Leader Gatherings  Hosted by the Boniu
	k Institute's Religion and Public Life Center (https://boniuk.rice.edu/RPL
	C)\, Religious &amp\; Civic Leader Gatherings are a series of carefully cu
	rated events that connect local leaders with current research relevant to 
	the work they do in the their communities.&#160\; This group spans all fai
	th traditions (an those of no faith affiliation) and is designed to build 
	a well-informed network of leaders who make Houston a more vibrant city.&#
	160\;  &#160\;If you are a religious or community leader and would like to
	 receive an invitation to these events\, please email Hayley Hemstreet at 
	hjh@rice.edu (mailto:hjh@rice.edu).\n\nhttps://events.rice.edu/event/43503
	3-religious-civic-leader-gathering-the-future-of-religi
